<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Rufumbira New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">ABAKOLOSAAYI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="toc2">ABAKOLOSAAYI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Urwandiko Intumwa Pawulo yandikiye ABAKOLOSAAYI</para>
  <para style="mt2">Urwandiko Intumwa Pawulo yandikiye</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABAKOLOSAAYI</para>
  <para style="imt">INYANZURO</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Urwandiko Intumwa Pawulo yandikiye Abakolosaayi</char> rwandikiwe itoorero ry'i Kolosaayi, riri mu tawuni ya Asiya ntooya mubuvaazuuba bwa Efeeso. Iri toorero nti ryari ryaratangiwe na Pawulo, ariko ryari mu mwanya wo Pawulo yumvaga ko awushinzwe ubwo yooherezaga abakozi muri Efeeso, i tawuni nkuru yo mu gice ca Rooma muri Asiya ntooya. Pawulo yari yaramenye yuuko hari abiigiishabinyoma mu itoorero ry'i Kolosaayi baakomeje gushimangira ngo ntaawamenya Imaana cangwa ngo abone agakiza nyaako abaaye ataramya “bamwe mu bayobozi b'ibyumwuka cangwa ubutegetsi bumwe.” Ikindi kandi, aba biigiishabinyoma baavugaga yuuko umuntu akwiriye kugira imigenzo idasanzwe yuubahiriza, nko gukebwa kandi agakurikiza amategeko atavuguruzwa agenga ibyokurya n'indi migenzo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nuuko reero Intumwa Pawulo yandika ahakanya inyigiisho z'ibinyoma, yiigiisha ubutumwa bw'ukuri bwa gikristo. Ic'ingenzi mu gusubiza kwe n'ukwemeza ko Yesu Kristo ashobora gutanga agakiza mu bwuzuye kandi ko uko kwizeera kundi nyamara kuyobora abantu kuva kuri Kristo. Imaana yaremye isi ibikeesha Kristo, kandi inyuriye muri we, Imaana iziigarurira isi. Mukugira ubumwe na Kristo nimwo hasangwa ibyiringiro by'agakiza ku isi. Nuuko reero Pawulo asobaanura ico iyi nyigiisho y'ingenzi imenyeesha mu bugingo bw'abiizeera.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bikwiriye kumenywa yuuko Tukiko, uwo Pawulo yoohereje kujaanira uru rwandiko itoorero ry'i Kolosaayi, yari aherekejwe na Oneesimaasi, wari imbaata ya Filimooni. Niwe Pawulo yari yarandikiye sheebuja Filimooni urwandiko amusabira imbabazi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ibirimo</para>
  <para style="io1">Inyanzuro <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kamere ya Kristo hamwe n'umurimo we <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:9-2:19">1:9—2:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ubuzima busha muri Kristo <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 2:20-4:6">2:20—4:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Umusoozo <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Indamutso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Njeewe Pawulo, Intumwa ya Kristo Yesu ku bw'ubushaake bw'Imaana, na Timoteeyo mwene daata,<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />turabandikiye mwebwe abantu b'Imaana, kandi bavandimwe baacu biizeerwa muri Kristo bari i Kolosaayi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Imaana Daata ibagirire ubuntu n'amahoro.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo Ashiima Imaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Igihe tubasabira, duhora dushiima Imaana Se w'Umwami waacu Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />kuko twumviise uko mwizeera Yesu Kristo n'urukundo mufitiye abantu b'Imaana. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Uko kwizeera kwanyu gushingiye ku byiringiro by'ibyiza mwagenewe mu ijuru. Ibyo byiringiro mwabanje kubimenyeeshwa n'ijambo ry'ukuri, ari bwo Butumwa Bwiza mwagejejweho. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Nk'uko ubwo butumwa bwamaze gukwira ku isi hoose kandi bukagira ingaruka nziiza, ni na ko bimeze no muri mwe, uheereye igihe mwabwumviise kandi mugasobaanukirwa by'ukuri ubuntu bw'Imaana. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Kol 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Fili 1:23</ref>.</char></note>Iby'ubuntu bw'Imaana mwabyigiye kuri Epafura mugenzi waacu dufatanya umurimo. Ni umukozi udahemuka wa Kristo ukora mu mwanya waanyu. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Ni we watumenyeesheje ibyerekeye urukundo mufite muyobowe n'Umwuka Weera.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Ni co gituma naatwe tudasiiba kubasengera uheereye igihe twumviise ibyo, dusaba ngo Imaana ibuuzuzemo ubwenge bwo kumenya ubushaake bwayo, ubuhanga no gusobaanukirwa bitangwa n'Umwuka waayo. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Bityo, muzaashobora kubaho nk'uko Umwami waacu abishaaka kandi muhore mukora ibimushiimiisha. Ubuzima bwanyu buzeera imbuto z'ibikorwa byiza by'uburyo bwose mwiyongera kurushaho mu kumenya Imaana. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Kandi turabasengera ngo Imaana ibahe gukomera koose kuva mu mbaraga z'ikuzo ryayo, kugira ngo bibashoboze kwiteguurira kwihangaanira byose mudacoogora kandi mufite umuneezeero, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />mushiimira Imaana Daata yabahaaye kugabana ku murage wagenewe abantu baayo mu muco. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Imaana yaradukijije ituvaana mu butware bw'umwijima, itujaana mu Bwami bw'Umwana waayo ikunda, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe 1:7</ref>.</char></note>ari na we dukeesha gucungurwa kandi ari ko kubabarirwa ibyaha byacu.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo n'Umurimo we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kristo ni we shusho y'Imaana itareebwa n'amaaso. Ni we mfura yaayo mu byaremwe byose. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Kuko Imaana yaremye ibintu byose biri mu ijuru no mu isi inyuriye muri we, hari ibigaragara n'ibitagaragara, bwaba ubwami cangwa ubutegetsi, abategetsi cangwa imbaraga, byose byaremwe na we kandi ni we byaremewe. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Kristo yabaayeho mbere ya byose, kandi ni we uhuuriza byose hamwe. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:22">Efe 1:22</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 1:23">23</ref>.</char></note>Ni we mutwe w'umubiri we, ari wo toorero. Ni we ntangiriro kandi ni we wabanjirije boose kuzuuka kugira ngo afate umwanya w'ibanze muri byose. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Imaana yashimye ko kuuzura kwayo koose kuba mu Mwana waayo, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Efe 2:16</ref>.</char></note>kandi uwo Mwana waayo ni we Imaana yanyuriyemo kugira ngo yiiyuzuze n'ibintu byose, byaba ibyo mu isi cangwa ibyo mu ijuru, mu kuuzana amahoro ibikeesha amaraso Umwana waayo yamennye ku musaraba.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Noone namwe abaari baariitandukanyije n'Imaana mukaba abanzi baayo ku bw'ibibi birangwa n'ibikorwa hamwe n'ibiteekerezo byanyu, <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />ubu Imaana yiiyunze namwe inyuriye mu rupfu rw'umwana waayo, watanze umubiri we kugira ngo ibaheeshe guhagarara imbere yaayo muri abeera, badafite inenge cangwa umugayo. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Icakora mukwiriye gukomeza kwizeera kwanyu gushingiye ku musinge ukomeye kandi ntimwemere kunyeganyezwa ngo muteeshuke ku byiringiro mwahaawe ubwo mwumviise ubutumwa bwiza. Ubu ni bwo Butumwa Bwiza bwo njeewe Pawulo mbeereye umugaragu, bwamamajwe mu isi yoose.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubuheereza bwa Pawulo i Kolosaayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Ubu, neejeejwe n'uko mbabazwa ku bwanyu, iyo umubiri wanje utootezwa, mba nuuzuza ibyasaaze igihe Kristo yababarizwaga umubiri we, ari wo toorero. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Imaana yantooranyije kuba umuheereza w'itoorero kandi ni yo yampaaye uyu murimo ku bwanyu, kugira ngo naamamaze ijambo ry'Imaana mu bwuzuye. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Iryo banga ryari ryarahishwe uheereye keera kandi n'ibihe byose ariko ubu rimaze guhishuurirwa abantu b'Imaana. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Imaana ifite umugambi wo guhishuurira abanyamahanga ikuzo ry'iryo banga ry'agaciiro ifitiye abantu boose. Iryo banga ni uko mufite umwuka wa Kristo muri mwe bigatuma mugira ibyiringiro byo kuzaabona ku mugabane w'ikuzo ry'Imaana. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Kristo uwo ni we twamamaza, dukoreesha ubwenge bwose uko bishoboka kubuurira no kwigiisha abantu boose kugira ngo tugeze buri umwe imbere y'Imaana amaze gukura muri Kristo. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Ni co gituma nduha kandi ngaharanira ibi nkoreesheje imbaraga zoose mpaabwa na Kristo.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Niifuuza yuuko mumenya ukuntu mbaharanira mwe ab'i Kolosaayi, hamwe n'ab'i Lawodikeya kandi n'abandi boose batarambonaho. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Ibi mbikora kugira ngo imitima yaabo ihuumurizwe kandi bagire ubumwe mu rukundo, maze barusheho gusobaanukirwa kandi bagire ubwenge bw'ibanga ry'Imaana, ari ryo Kristo ubwe. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Muri we ni mwo ubuhanga n'ubwenge bw'Imaana buhishwe.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Mbabwiye ibyo kugira ngo hatagira ubabeeshabeesha n'amagambo y'ibinyoma. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />N'ubwo ntari kumwe namwe, mbahoza ku mutima, kandi biraaneezeeza kubona mushishikariye gukomerera mu kwizeera Kristo.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubugingo Bwuzuye Bubonerwa muri Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Nuuko reero nk'uko mwakiiriye Kristo Yesu Umwami waacu, abe ari ko mukomeza kugendera muri we mu buzima bwanyu bwose, <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />mushooreye imizi muri we kandi ubugingo bwanyu bwubakiwe kuri we, nk'uko mwigiishijwe kandi mushiima Imaana ubudasiiba.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Muramenye ntihakagire ubanyagiisha ubwenge n'inyigiisho z'abantu cangwa ngo mubeeshwe n'imigenzo karande y'abantu hamwe no gutegekwa n'imbaraga z'imyuka itegeka isi idashingiye kuri Kristo. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Kuko ibyuzuye mu bumaana byose bibonerwa muri Kristo wabaaye umuntu, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />kandi namwe mwahaawe ubugingo bwuzuye muri we. Ni we mutware w'ubutegetsi n'ubushobozi bwose.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Kandi ku bwa Kristo mwakebwe mu buryo bw'umwuka, bituma muvanwa mu mbaraga z'icaaha gishingiye kuri kamere. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Rom 6:4</ref>.</char></note>Ubwo mwahambanywe na we igihe mwabatizwaga, ni na ko mwazuukanye na we mu kwizeera imbaraga z'Imaana yamuzuuye mu baapfuuye. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Efe 2:1-5</ref>.</char></note>Kandi ubwo mwari mwarapfuye muzize ibyaha byanyu no kudakebwa, Imaana yatuzuuriye hamwe na Kristo, igihe yatubabariye ibicumuro byose, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:15">Efe 2:15</ref>.</char></note>ihanagura ibyatwanditsweho bidushinja ku bw'amategeko tutaakurikije, nuuko bibambwa ku musaraba. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Kuri uwo musaraba ni ho Kristo yatsindiye ubutware bw'imyuka mibi itegeka, akabuhemurira ku mugaragaro, akereekana intsinzi muri byose.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:1-6">Rom 14:1-6</ref>.</char>
    </note>Nuuko reero, ntihakagire ubaciira urubanza mu byerekeye ibyo murya cangwa ibyo munywa, cangwa ibyerekeye iminsi y'ibirori, iboneka ry'ukwezi cangwa Isaabato. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Ibyo byose n'igishushaanyo c'ibizaaza, naho ukuri nyaako ni Kristo. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Kandi ntihakagire ubaciira urubanza yiiyerekana ko akomeye ku bwo kwerekwa kudasanzwe no gusenga abamalayika. Uwigira atyo, aba akurikije ibiteekerezo bye bya kamere muntu. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:16">Efe 4:16</ref>.</char></note>Abo biitandukanyije na Kristo kandi ari we mutwe w'umubiri. Kristo ni we ugaburira umubiri woose kandi ni we rufatiro rw'ingingo n'imitsi yoose, bikayiteera kumera neeza nk'uko Imaana ibishaaka.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gupfa no Kuzuukira muri Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Niiba reero mwarapfanye na Kristo, mudategekwa n'imyuka mibi itegeka iyi si, mbese ni kuki muciifata nk'aho muri ab'isi? Ni kuki mukomeza kugengwa n'amategeko nk'aya, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />ngo “ntuugafate iki,” cangwa “ntuukaroze kiriya,” cangwa ngo “ntuugakore kuri kino”? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Ibyo byose bitaakaza agaciiro iyo bimaze gukoreeshwa, n'amategeko n'inyigiisho z'abantu gusa. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Ni koko kuubahiriza aya mategeko bisa nk'aho ari bwo buryo bukwiriye. Bituma urebeka nk'aho ukunda Imaana caane no kwiciisha bugufi hamwe no kwifata. Nyamara akaba ntambaraga bifite mu kurwanya irari ry'umubiri.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ubugingo Busha muri Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Niiba reero mwarazuukanye na Kristo, muharanire ibyo mu ijuru, aho Kristo yiicaye ku ntebe y'ubwami, iburyo bw'Imaana. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Muhoze umutima ku byo mu ijuru atari ku byo mu isi, <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />kuko mwapfaanye na Kristo kandi ubugingo bwanyu bukaba buhishwe hamwe na Kristo mu Maana. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Igihe Kristo we bugingo bwanyu nyakuri azeerekanwa, ni ho namwe muzeerekanwa na we, mufite ikuzo rye.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Nuuko reero, nimwitandukanye n'irari ryanyu ry'iby'isi ribarimo, nk'ubusambanyi, gukora ibiteeye isoni, kurarikira ibibi, kurarikira ibirenze kubyo mufite, kuko iyo mugize mutyo, muba mushira imbere ubutunzi bw'isi, ari ko kuramya ibigirwamaana. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Ku bw'ibyo, umujinya w'Imaana ugiiye kuuzira abo batayumvira. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Kandi namwe ubwanyu mwagenzaga mutyo keera mugikora ibyo bibi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangwa se mukibaana naabo batumvira Imaana </char></note>.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Ariko ubu mukwiriye kuzinukwa ibyo bintu byose, nk'uburaakari, umujinya, itimwe, no gutukana, kandi ntihakagire amagambo ateeye isoni ava mu kanwa kanyu. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Efe 4:22</ref>.</char></note>Ntimukabeesherane kuko mwiyambuye kamere yaanyu ya keera hamwe n'imigenzereze yaayo <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:24">Efe 4:24</ref>.</char></note>mukambara kamere nsha, ivugururirwa no gusobaanukirwa kwanyu hamwe n'ishusho nk'iryuwayiremye. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Muri iryo vugururwa, ntihaba hakiriho gutandukanya Umugiriki n'Umuyuuda, uwakebwe n'utaarakebwe, umunyamahanga ugayitse cangwa injiji, imbaata cangwa uw'umudendeezo, ahuubwo Kristo ni byose kandi ari muri boose.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:2">Efe 4:2</ref>.</char>
    </note>Naho mwebwe, abo Imaana yatooranyije, ikabagira abeera kandi ab'igikundiro, mukwiriye kugira imbabazi, ineeza, kwiciisha bugufi, ubugwaneeza hamwe no kwihangaana. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Efe 4:32</ref>.</char></note>Mwihangaanirane kandi niiba umwe agize ico apfa n'undi mubabarirane. Nk'uko Umwami waacu yabababariye, abe ari ko namwe mubabarirana. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Kandi kuri ibyo byose, mwongereho urukundo, ni rwo ruduhuuriza hamwe mu gutungaana rwose. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Nuuko reero, ni mureke amahoro ya Kristo agenge imitima yaanyu, kuko ari yo mwahamagariwe ngo mube umwe. Kandi muje muhora mushiima. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19">Efe 5:19</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 5:20">20</ref>.</char></note>Maze mwemerere ijambo rya Kristo kuuzura mu bugingo bwanyu rwose, mugire n'ubwenge bwo kwiigiishanya no kugiirana inaama. Muje mushiimira Imaana mu mitima yaanyu muyiririmbira Zaaburi, ibisingizo n'izindi ndirimbo mubwirijwe n'Umwuka. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Kandi ico muzaavuga coose n'ibyo muzaakora byose, mubikore mu izina ry'Umwami Yesu, mushiima Imaana Daata mubikeesha Kristo.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imibaanire Ikwiriye Amago y'Abakristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Pet 3:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bagore, mwubahe abagabo baanyu kuko ari byo mukwiriye gukora nk'abakristo.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1Pet 3:7</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bagabo, mukunde abagore baanyu kandi ntimukabagirire umwaga.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efe 6:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Baana, muje mwumvira ababyeyi baanyu muri byose, kuko ari byo bishiimiisha Imaana.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efe 6:4</ref>.</char>
    </note>Babyeyi, ntimukaraakaze abaana baanyu kugira ngo badaciika intege.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe 6:5-8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Namwe bagaragu muje mwumvira ba shoobuja bo ku isi muri byose, ntimubikore ari uko babareeba kugira ngo mubaneezeeze, ahuubwo muje mubikora mubikuuye ku mitima yaanyu kandi mwubaha Imaana. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Ibyo mukora byose, muje mubikora mubikuuye ku mutima nk'abakorera Nyagasani atari ugukorera abantu, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />ubwo muuzi yuuko Nyagasani azaabahemba umurage yabageneye kandi Kristo ni we shoobuja mukuru mukorera. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6:9</ref>.</char></note>Ukora ibibi weese azaabihanirwa kuko Imaana itarobaanura ku butoni.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6:9</ref>.</char>
    </note>Namwe abafite abo mukoreesha mubahe ibikwiriye n'ibitunganye, mwibuka yuuko namwe mufite shoobuja wo mu ijuru.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Andi Mabwiriza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Mukomeze gusenga, muba maaso kandi mushiima. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Kandi natwe mudusengere kugira ngo Imaana iduteguurire uburyo bwo kuvuga ijambo ryayo, twamamaze ubutumwa bw'ibanga rya Kristo, ariyo mpamvu itumye ndi mu gihome. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Nuuko reero munsengere kugira ngo mvuge iryo jambo uko bikwiriye.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:16">Efe 5:16</ref>.</char>
    </note>Muje mugira ubwenge mu buryo mwifata ku bataazi Kristo, mukoreesha neeza igihe mufite. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Amagambo muvuga aje arangwa n'ineeza, nk'ibyokurya birimo umuunyu, kugira ngo mumenye uko mukwiriye gusubiza buri umwe.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umusoozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Iby 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Tim 4:12</ref>.</char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Efe 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref>.</char>
    </note>Tukiko, mwene Daata ukundwa kandi umwiringirwa dukorana umurimo w'Umwami waacu Kristo, azaababwira ibimfasheho byose. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Ico ni co gitumye mubooherereza, kugira ngo abamenyeeshe uko turi kandi abakomeze. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Fili 1:10-12</ref>.</char></note>Azanye na Oneesimaasi, mwene Daata wizeerwa kandi umwe muri mwe. Bari bubabwire iby'ino byose.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Iby 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Fili 1:24</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Iby 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>.</char>
    </note>Arisitariko wo dusibwe hamwe arabataasha, na Mariko mubyara wa Barinaba arabataasha. Naaza iwaanyu, muzamwakiire neeza mukurikije ibyo mwabwiwe. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Na Yesu wiitwa Yusito arabataasha. Aba ni bo boonyine mu Bayuuda beemeye Kristo dufatanya umurimo wo kwamamaza Ubwami bw'Imaana kandi baaramfashije caane.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Fili 1:23</ref>.</char>
    </note>Epafura uvuuka iwaanyu arabataasha, na we ni umugaragu wa Kristo Yesu. Ahora ashiishikariye kubasengera, kugira ngo mushikame kandi mutungaane rwose, mumenye neeza mudashidiikanya ibyo Imaana ishaaka byose. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Mufiteho ubuhamya yuuko agira umwete wo kubakorera, mwebwe hamwe n'ab'i Lawodikeya n'ab'i Hiyerapoli. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:11">2 Tim 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Fili 1:24</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10">2 Tim 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Fili 1:24</ref>.</char></note>Luka umuvuuzi ukundwa, hamwe na Dema barabataasha.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Mutaashe abavandimwe bari i Lawodikeya, na Numfa hamwe n'itoorero riteeranira mu nzu iwe. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Kandi uru rwandiko nimumara kurusomerwa, ruzaasomerwe n'itoorero ry'i Lawodikeya, namwe muzaasome uruzaava i Lawodikeya. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Fili 1:2</ref>.</char></note>Mubwire Arukipo muti, “Ureebe ngo ushikirije umurimo wahaawe gukorera Nyagasani.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Ni njeewe Pawulo wiyandikiye iyi ndamutso. Kandi muje mwibuka yuuko nsibwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Ubuntu bw'Imaana bube muri mwe.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>